<div class="text guide-styles" data-units-dynamic="article" data-zaf-dynamic="article" id="guide-body" lang="en">
<div class="markup-toc-wrapper">
<button class="markup-toc-button">Show Table of Contents</button></div>Welcome to Wowhead's Pre-Raid Best in Slot Gear List for Beast Mastery Hunter DPS in Cataclysm Classic Phase 4. Gear in this guide is primarily obtained from Twilight Protocol Dungeons and Valor Points. This guide will list the recommended gear for your class and role, containing gear sourced from dungeons, PvP, professions, Bind on Equip drops, and reputations.<h2 class="heading-size-2" id="best-in-slot">
<span class="c3">Best in Slot Gear for Beast Mastery Hunter DPS in Pre-Raid</span></h2>As a Beast Mastery Hunter your first set as always is reaching your hit cap. Luckily a lot of best in slot pre-raid gear has plenty of hit so you should have no issues at all reaching the hit cap of 961 rating. Also with Cataclysm and the reforging system it is easier than ever.<br/>
<br/>
<div class="wh-center" style="text-align: -webkit-center;">
<br/>
