<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="chest-for-beast-mastery-hunter-dps">Chest for Beast Mastery Hunter DPS</h4>For the chest you will want <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=78756/wyrmstalkers-tunic">
