<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="trinkets-for-beast-mastery-hunter-dps">Trinkets for Beast Mastery Hunter DPS</h4>For the two trinkets you will want to aim for <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=77974/wrath-of-unchaining">
<img alt="Wrath of Unchaining" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_coin_13.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Wrath of Unchaining</span></a> and <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=77979/vial-of-shadows">
<img alt="Vial of Shadows" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_potion_85.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Vial of Shadows</span></a>. These two trinkets should be relatively easy to obtain and they're also much, much better than any alternative.<br/>These trinkets should be your first purchases with <a class="icontiny q1" data-entity="currency" data-game="wow" data-type="currency" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/currency=3281/obsidian-fragment">
<span>
<img alt="Obsidian Fragment" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_stone_15.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Obsidian Fragment</span></span></a> after getting 2-set T13.<div class="pad"></div>
