<h3 class="heading-size-3" id="weapons">Weapons for Beast Mastery Hunter DPS</h3>
<div class="pad"></div>
<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="melee-weapons-for-beast-mastery-hunter-dps">Melee Weapons for Beast Mastery Hunter DPS</h4>As a <span class="c3">Beast Mastery Hunter</span> in Cataclysm you will typically want to always use a 2h weapon and ignore 1h options.<br/>
<br/>
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=78482/kiril-fury-of-beasts">
<img alt="Kiril, Fury of Beasts" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/polearm_2h_deathwingraiddw_d_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Kiril, Fury of Beasts</span></a> is the absolute best weapon we can get pre raid, and is easy to obtain. <br/>
<br/>
<b>Recommended BiS Weapon Enchants</b>: <a class="q1 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=68134/enchant-2h-weapon-mighty-agility">
